### ============================================================
### Security checks — verify whitelist and JWT protection
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Public: register (should be 201 or 409 if user exists)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "security-test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "displayName": "Security Test"
}

### Public: login (should be 200, returns a token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "security-test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Public: health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Public: OpenAPI JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs

### Public: Swagger UI
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui.html

### Protected: task list WITHOUT token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks

### Protected: task list WITH invalid token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.value

### Protected: task list WITH valid token → 200
### (paste the token from the login request above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_YOUR_JWT_HERE